<main class="write-main"><h1>Footer visitor statistics</h1><?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>Now · current month · current year</h2><p>Status: <?=e($statistics['status']??'Not refreshed')?>. <a href="<?=url('/write/google#diagnostics')?>">Google diagnostics</a></p><p>Visible public pages send a presence event every 30 seconds only after Analytics consent. Now counts distinct users with that event in the current and previous minute; hidden tabs stop sending. The worker refreshes that aggregate every minute. It is a recent-activity measure, not a claim of instantaneous physical occupancy.</p><p>Month and year are separate GA4 totalUsers reports, refreshed every five minutes. Google’s own processing latency still applies. The year is never calculated by adding months. Period boundaries follow the verified property time zone. Browser labels and readings refresh every 30 seconds without reloading the page.</p><p>Wrong-period, thresholded, missing and expired readings are withheld. Public polling exposes only aggregates and cannot trigger provider requests. The source must remain bound to the deployed website tag and its selected property.</p>
<form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn primary">Refresh verified statistics</button></form>
<table><thead><tr><th>Counter</th><th>Verified value</th><th>Last query</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(['active'=>['Now','active_at','realtime_status'],'monthly_visitors'=>['Current month','month_at','month_status'],'yearly_visitors'=>['Current year','year_at','year_status']]as$key=>[$label,$stamp,$status]):?><tr><td><?=e($label)?></td><td><?=isset($statistics[$key])?number_format($statistics[$key]):'Not confirmed'?></td><td><?=!empty($statistics[$stamp])?e(date('j M Y H:i:s',$statistics[$stamp])):'Not queried'?></td><td><?=e($statistics[$status]??'Pending')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table><p>Time zone: <?=e($statistics['timezone']??'Not verified')?> · Month: <?=e($statistics['month']??'Not queried')?> · Year: <?=e($statistics['year']??'Not queried')?></p>
</section></main>
